[{"title":"上京十咏 其四 黄鼠","author":"许有壬","text":"北产推珍味，南来怯陋容。\n瓠肥宜不武，人拱若为恭。\n发掘怜禽狝，招徕或水攻。\n君毋急盘馔，幸自不穿墉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11847,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上京十咏 其五 籸面","author":"许有壬","text":"坡远花全白，霜轻实便黄。\n杵头麸退墨，硙齿雪流香。\n玉叶翻盘薄，银丝出漏长。\n元宵贮膏火，蒸墨笑南乡。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11848,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上京十咏 其六 芦菔","author":"许有壬","text":"性质宜沙地，栽培属夏畦。\n熟登甘似芋，生荐脆如梨。\n老病消凝滞，奇功直品题。\n故园长尺许，青叶更堪齑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11849,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上京十咏 其七 白菜","author":"许有壬","text":"土羔新且嫩，筐筥荐纷披。\n可作青菁饭，仍携玉版师。\n清风牙颊响，真味士夫知。\n南土称秋末，投簪要及时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11850,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上京十咏 其八 沙菌","author":"许有壬","text":"牛羊膏润足，物产借英华。\n帐脚骈遮地，钉头怒戴沙。\n斋厨供玉食，毳索出毡车。\n莫作垂涎想，家园有莫邪。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11851,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上京十咏 其九 地椒","author":"许有壬","text":"冻雨催花紫，轻风散野香。\n刺沙尖叶细，敷地乱条长。\n楚客收成裹，奚童撷满筐。\n行厨供草具，调鼎尔非良。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11852,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上京十咏 其十 韭花","author":"许有壬","text":"西风吹野韭，花发满沙陀。\n气校荤蔬媚，功于肉食多。\n浓香跨姜桂，馀味及瓜茄。\n我欲收其实，归山种涧阿。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11853,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寻梅","author":"许有壬","text":"何以慰吾衰，梅花秀发时。\n晚香传远树，春雪避南枝。\n林静来差早，溪深行独迟。\n与君谋一醉，及此未离披。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11854,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"水木清华亭宴集十四韵并序","author":"许有壬","text":"世禄推门阀，天墀几拜嘉。\n高情忘势利，大隐谢纷哗。\n朝市尘无染，蓬瀛路岂赊。\n眷言营别墅，初不远东华。\n画舸堂前过，青帘柳外斜。\n晴红迷菡萏，寒翠接蒹葭。\n挥麈风生座，扶筇雨压沙。\n萍开轻泛鸭，荷侧重擎蛙。\n只讶神仙府，谁知宰相家。\n宾朋玄圃玉，文采赤城霞。\n丽曲凝云表，仙妆炫水涯。\n添栽三径竹，递赏四时花。\n心事尊中物，人生海上槎。\n相逢须尽兴，明日各趋衙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11855,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送马明初教授南归二十韵并序","author":"许有壬","text":"吾子昔倾盖，琅瓈古渡头。\n袖文惊蜀锦，怀宝重天球。\n心既同金断，胶因向漆投。\n有邀须共往，无倡不为酬。\n南岳朝联辔，湘江暮舣舟。\n屐穷峰顶寺，诗满水边楼。\n访古由来喜，寻芳到处留。\n遂移衡浦隐，便作武昌游。\n坐席何曾暖，招旌遽见求。\n高情安旅次，遐躅又神州。\n道路多尝险，山川只荐愁。\n扫云髡兔颖，鏖雪敝貂裘。\n善诱儿何幸，深藏价未收。\n忽看鸿鹄举，甘效蟨蛩休。\n洹水寒偏瑩，林虑晚更幽。\n谁知三仕已，相累十春秋。\n公道先扬善，真才自拔尤。\n恩袍明翡翠，教铎振貔貅。\n行役仍清淡，言归邈阻修。\n临岐惟一语，音信莫悠悠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11856,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寿李秋谷平章","author":"许有壬","text":"黄钟嘘㬉挽春留，绿蚁浮香带月篘。\n宰相得閒才是贵，人生有子更何求。\n家传文字五千卷，身在神仙十二楼。\n记取年年好风景，雪松霜桧岂容秋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11857,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送黄文复归长沙","author":"许有壬","text":"半生湖海梦依稀，但诵湘南远寄诗。\n先友凋残公独健，故园荒尽我方归。\n百年未满常忧畏，千里相逢又别离。\n他日瓈江松下路，西州难似此沾衣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11858,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"横山有高竹楼别业留信宿始归","author":"许有壬","text":"酒香牲腯主人归，正是猿惊鹤怨时。\n梅影小池春入画，竹声虚阁夜催诗。\n世间真乐无多事，身外浮名只费辞。\n他日结茅容我隐，一章先当买山赀。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11859,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"九日陪阖台诸公登石头城","author":"许有壬","text":"一江环抱四山围，酬节追欢剩费诗。\n雁影不移云尽处，秋光都在雨晴时。\n当年玉树人何在，明日黄花蝶岂知。\n便驻高轩?醉倒，绝胜无酒绕东篱。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11860,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题昌平刘建议祠","author":"许有壬","text":"一卷春秋两鬓皤，丹诚贯日口悬河。\n策能匡世时不用，天实厌唐人奈何。\n自古大材多薄命，而今我辈亦登科。\n可怜熏腐俱尘土，得似高名永不磨。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11861,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"游昌平憩县学归过朱都督碑","author":"许有壬","text":"木叶才霜水不波，偷閒今日遂婆娑。\n清秋林壑斜阳好，丰岁郊原乐事多。\n秦塞已隳仍郡县，武城虽小有弦歌。\n却怜一片朱家石，千古泾原臭不磨。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11862,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"神山即事","author":"许有壬","text":"京尘汨没已华颠，恰是山居第一年。\n松月照窗诗入圣，竹风吹榻梦游仙。\n随人久作悠悠者，处世方知绰绰然。\n尚愧未能忘口腹，时劳昆季致肥鲜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11863,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和谢敬德学士见寄韵 其一","author":"许有壬","text":"平生疏懒是天姿，今岁春来起亦迟。\n好酒或如陶靖节，杜门深愧郑当时。\n向来事业惟供笑，如此风光忍废诗。\n馆阁真才试枚举，鹄山陪预恐难期。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11864,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和谢敬德学士见寄韵 其二","author":"许有壬","text":"淡霭轻风弄野姿，江天寥廓鸟飞迟。\n从知宇宙多閒地，谁信襟怀胜旧时。\n夜雨不惊逋客梦，暮云犹入故人诗。\n山中亦有阳春曲，拂拭朱弦待子期。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11865,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"登岳阳楼","author":"许有壬","text":"半空轮奂壮巴丘，消得骚人一系舟。\n云气远携湘雨至，湖光寒入蜀江流。\n山川信美非吾土，天地无穷有此楼。\n三十四年如梦过，可怜华发赋重游。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11866,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"黄陵庙","author":"许有壬","text":"黄陵庙下草萋萋，水远山长听竹枝。\n末路不求同死处，重华宁有再来时。\n霜筠苦泪留千古，野树愁云接九疑。\n珍重韩公修废坠，却怜侥福类神私。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11867,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"过湘潭","author":"许有壬","text":"江边杨柳翠萦回，柳外人家罨画开。\n一夜东风花落尽，千年华表鹤归来。\n暮云山出远浮黛，春雨水添浓泼醅。\n莫舣扁舟访陈迹，白头怀抱易生哀。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11868,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"祝融峰与廷镇觞咏有怀欧阳原功盖尝约同游而予不能待其归也","author":"许有壬","text":"载酒穷跻最上峰，啸歌声撼海涛风。\n得陪五马二千石，独少三生六一翁。\n为问北门红日下，何如南岳白云中。\n寄诗几欲申前约，无奈人生似燕鸿。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11869,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"时雨忽降簿书甚稀独坐王可矩右司有诗次其韵 其一","author":"许有壬","text":"翠樾云深百鸟鸣，彤闱如水嫩凉生。\n雨声自与诗有约，天巧岂容人强名。\n万里秋风黄鹄梦，五湖春水白鸥盟。\n年来不用愁华发，尚有观山老眼明。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11870,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"时雨忽降簿书甚稀独坐王可矩右司有诗次其韵 其二","author":"许有壬","text":"西厅东阁总诗鸣，天籁相关触处生。\n京国故人多老病，洛阳才子独声名。\n风云幸际文昌运，松柏休忘岁晚盟。\n他日江湖携手去，尽渠蚊睫有焦明。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11871,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题武卫段指挥书林","author":"许有壬","text":"相府深沈书若林，牙签插架列森森。\n千枝万叶本根在，二帝三王雨露深。\n椔翳斯文功利学，栋梁来世圣贤心。\n经残百氏纷纭出，慎勿轻栖恶木阴。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11872,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"閒居杂诗 其一","author":"许有壬","text":"鬓发苍浪齿动摇，自知宜退待谁招。\n茶馀引鹤消春昼，酒醒闻鸡记早朝。\n肥截玉肪羹缩项，香翻云子饭长腰。\n尚嫌门有徵诗客，时与山人破寂寥。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11873,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"閒居杂诗 其二","author":"许有壬","text":"半山云树接修篁，镇日无尘到草堂。\n瓮牖风来书叶乱，胆瓶花落砚池香。\n壶觞自酌教微醉，松菊犹存及未荒。\n护果灌园常不暇，谁知閒里更多忙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11874,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"閒居杂诗 其三","author":"许有壬","text":"鹄山东北接郊墟，郭影岚光画不如。\n九十日春朝暮雨，两三间屋古今书。\n庭花红碍经行处，园竹青回剪伐馀。\n满地苍苔愁踏破，年来深喜故人疏。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11875,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"閒居杂诗 其四","author":"许有壬","text":"窃禄多惭号具臣，归田何幸作閒人。\n登山临水今非客，病酒愁花又过春。\n梦断紫霄黄阁远，眼明青镜白头新。\n芥薹竹笋来相续，不道茅柴味更真。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11876,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和傅汝砺寄来韵 其一","author":"许有壬","text":"江水舟航日夜东，故人音问得常通。\n君才能挽千钧重，我老惟怀一亩宫。\n自古山林容小隐，只今台省有诸公。\n欲知别后诗成处，都在花香竹影中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11877,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和傅汝砺寄来韵 其二","author":"许有壬","text":"春红园圃眩西东，花下萦纡一径通。\n不向雷门操布鼓，要从人海见珠宫。\n多言浪负三千牍，老梦都忘十八公。\n珍重吾宗有成训，人间何似在山中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11878,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题西域木唐卿旌表孝义卷","author":"许有壬","text":"桥梓天殊棣有华，良心初不间幽遐。\n何年四海无旌表，尽化忠臣孝子家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11879,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"琳宫词次安南王韵 其二","author":"许有壬","text":"山中活计只餐霞，世事茫茫日自斜。\n谪到玉堂无好况，夜深犹草侍中麻。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11880,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"织锦回文图","author":"许有壬","text":"明珠金缕烂萦回，香玉连环剪不开。\n不把肺肝都织出，将军惟识赵阳台。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11881,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杜子美象","author":"许有壬","text":"删后骚馀代有闻，集成惟许杜陵人。\n凭谁寄语沿流者，流到江西不是春。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11882,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赏心亭","author":"许有壬","text":"赏心亭上双柏树，看我往来今十年。\n柏树青青宛如昔，当时游子已华颠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11883,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"牛背观书图","author":"许有壬","text":"蒲鞯盘膝胜安舆，人讶形骸与世疏。\n却笑徙居三十乘，恰如牛背一编书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11884,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"丙吉问牛图","author":"许有壬","text":"肥充列鼎健充车，厚养专为簿领驱。\n千古清风梓人传，凭谁书继丙家图。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11885,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和康里子山韵","author":"许有壬","text":"洞深春早透兰芽，窗晓云香乱海霞。\n万丈红尘飞不到，紫箫吹绽碧桃花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11886,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"李陵台","author":"许有壬","text":"李陵台下驻分台，红药金莲遍地开。\n斜日一鞭三十里，北山飞雨逐人来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11887,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上都归口号","author":"许有壬","text":"娇儿幼女逐山妻，争解行囊看赐衣。\n颠倒海图裨短褐，可怜杜老北征归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11888,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"信笔","author":"许有壬","text":"造物知余素爱山，一官故调万山间。\n山深民朴官无事，却为观山日不閒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11889,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"冬夜即事","author":"许有壬","text":"纸窗铺月白溶溶，炉火欺灯照室红。\n万籁声沈人语定，好诗都在杳冥中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11890,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"行县书所见","author":"许有壬","text":"涨潦留泥粪稻畦，石渠分水灌麻池。\n醉翁社散忘归路，行过柴门尚不知。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11891,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"谢祐之桃花折枝","author":"许有壬","text":"天台不折一枝归，晴日明窗有所思。\n流水乱山迷去路，案图无语立多时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11892,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"令狐学士金莲图","author":"许有壬","text":"九天光彩动金闺，辇路风香树影齐。\n却笑汉家恩数薄，只教天禄待青藜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11893,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"神山杂诗 其一","author":"许有壬","text":"山留残雨湿拖云，竹引鲜飙细洒人。\n诗思清如寒水玉，休教落纸恐沾尘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11894,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"神山杂诗 其二","author":"许有壬","text":"窗扉九夏镇长开，一榻无尘地有苔。\n怪底山禽栖不稳，竹林风雨送凉来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11895,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次黎东山凤栖别墅韵 其一","author":"许有壬","text":"风漪翠舞躬耕稻，云锦红酣手种花。\n策杖寻君迷不得，有书声处是君家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11896,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次黎东山凤栖别墅韵 其二","author":"许有壬","text":"七里原头营别业，三间堂下有东篱。\n霜林不尽天如洗，都是山人未了诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11897,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"都门柳","author":"许有壬","text":"都门四十里青青，几度迎人几送行。\n老子有言来致柳，只烦相送莫相迎。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11898,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"书所见 其一","author":"许有壬","text":"陵坡野菜绿如铺，肤受方期宥老榆。\n菜少人多挑已尽，有榆从此尽无肤。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11899,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"书所见 其二","author":"许有壬","text":"田园卖尽及儿孙，少壮流移老病存。\n一段升平好图画，人间惟欠郑监门。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11900,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夜次馆陶 其一","author":"许有壬","text":"三老趋程不惮劳，船头坐看月轮高。\n烟村渔火微茫外，一簇人家是馆陶。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11901,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夜次馆陶 其二","author":"许有壬","text":"浦云林雾郁苍苍，水面无风晚自凉。\n今夜篷窗应不寐，计程三百是吾乡。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11902,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"林虑南楼","author":"许有壬","text":"西山为我晓烟开，正尔癃钟造物哀。\n更欲细看阴岭雾，老龙将雨出山来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11903,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题龙甫耕云堂","author":"许有壬","text":"满山深锁白英英，不解为霖但可耕。\n只恐无心忽飞去，野人何处望秋成。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11904,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"即事 其一","author":"许有壬","text":"几家门系钓鱼船，一阵风香燎麦烟。\n画出太平村落景，酒旗多在绿杨边。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11905,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"即事 其二","author":"许有壬","text":"远浦客帆明冉冉，前村牧笛响呜呜。\n园桑叶尽蚕成茧，庭树阴浓燕引雏。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11906,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春日漫述","author":"许有壬","text":"竹几蒲团懒最宜，不知花影隔窗移。\n邻翁忽报小瓮熟，老子坐忘成坐驰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11907,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"卧龙图","author":"许有壬","text":"能办人间大有年，九渊谁遣抱珠眠。\n等閒莫似隆中起，雨得西南蕞尔天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11908,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵袁通甫","author":"郭天锡","text":"晚风索索酒初醒，岩桂花开香满庭。\n掩书不读亦不寐，明暗一灯如露萤。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11909,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"凯歌乐词九首 其一 南征捷","author":"耶律铸","text":"食言自是是诬天，游鼎鱼疑戏洞渊。\n征信自从天北极，目无江表已多年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11910,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"凯歌乐词九首 其二 拔武昌","author":"耶律铸","text":"设奇包敌纵蒙冲，绝似飘风捲断蓬。\n填得大江流不得，先声已不见江东。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11911,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"凯歌乐词九首 其三 战芜湖","author":"耶律铸","text":"舳舻千里蔽江湖，擿挑楼船为骚除。\n先直前锋三十万，一通严鼓尽为鱼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11912,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"凯歌乐词九首 其四 下江东","author":"耶律铸","text":"举国全兵失要冲，可无一策抗元戎。\n细推馀百年来事，合册江神拜上公。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11913,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"凯歌乐词九首 其五 定三吴","author":"耶律铸","text":"奋威骁骑下三吴，神将飞驰一丈乌。\n视彼众虽千百万，黎民游动跨玄驹。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11914,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"凯歌乐词九首 其六 克临安","author":"耶律铸","text":"拟歌陌上行人去，犹是传歌陌上花。\n花解语时应也问，即今春色媚谁家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11915,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"凯歌乐词九首 其七 江南平","author":"耶律铸","text":"横野万艘金翅舰，总戎一册玉铃篇。\n长江岂限天南北，万劫坤灵戴一天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11916,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]